---
import { withBase } from '../../lib/urls';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import ProductCard from '../../components/ProductCard.astro';
import {products} from '../../data/products';
export function getStaticPaths(){return products.map(product=>({params:{slug:product.slug},props:{product}}));}
const {product:p}=Astro.props;
const related=products.filter(x=>x.slug!==p.slug).sort((a,b)=>Number(b.categoryId===p.categoryId)-Number(a.categoryId===p.categoryId)).slice(0,3);
---
<Layout title={`${p.name} · 产品介绍 · 新物`} description={p.description} active="products">
<div class="container detail-page">
  <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="面包屑"><a href={withBase('/')}>发现</a><span>/</span><a href={withBase(`/products/?category=${p.categoryId}`)}>{p.category}</a><span>/</span><span>{p.name}</span></nav>
  <section class="product-hero"><div class="detail-image" style={`--product-bg:${p.color}`}><span class="pill">{p.category}</span><img src={withBase(`/images/${p.image}.webp`)} alt={`${p.name} 官方产品图`} width="900" height="740" fetchpriority="high"/><span class="image-credit">图片来源 / {p.brand}</span></div><div class="product-summary"><span class="eyebrow">{p.brand}</span><h1>{p.name}</h1><h2>{p.subtitle}</h2><p>{p.description}</p><div class="tags">{p.tags.map(t=><span>{t}</span>)}</div><div class="evidence-label"><span class="tiny-dot"></span>资料介绍 · 尚未实测</div><div class="detail-actions"><a class="button" href={p.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">前往品牌官网 <Icon name="external" size={18}/></a><a class="text-link" href="#video-links">查看视频入口</a></div><p class="detail-disclaimer">按品牌公开资料整理 · 收录于 2026.09.18<br/>价格、服务地区与功能以品牌当前说明为准。</p></div></section>
  <nav class="detail-tabs" aria-label="页面目录"><a href="#scenes">能做什么</a><a href="#how-to">怎么使用</a><a href="#before-buy">购买前了解</a><a href="#video-links">外部视频</a><a href="#sources">资料来源</a></nav>
  <div class="detail-layout"><div class="detail-content">
    <section id="scenes"><span class="eyebrow">01 / IN REAL LIFE</span><h2>把功能，放进生活里。</h2><p class="section-intro">先理解它的用途，再判断它是否适合自己。下面的场景依据官方功能整理，体验问题有待实际验证。</p><div class="scene-list">{p.scenes.map(([title,description],i)=><article><span class="scene-number">0{i+1}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{description}</p></div></article>)}</div></section>
    <section id="how-to"><span class="eyebrow">02 / GET STARTED</span><h2>从拿到手，到用起来。</h2><ol class="steps">{p.steps.map(step=><li>{step}</li>)}</ol><p class="small-muted">以上为使用流程概览，实际操作请以对应型号的官方说明书为准。</p></section>
    <section id="before-buy"><span class="eyebrow">03 / BEFORE YOU BUY</span><h2>心动之前，再了解这些。</h2><div class="considerations">{p.questions.map(q=><p><Icon name="info" size={17}/><span>{q}</span></p>)}</div><div class="test-note"><Icon name="article" size={23}/><div><strong>我们目前还没有亲自测试这款产品。</strong><p>这是一份产品资料介绍。未来实测会补充设备版本、测试过程、结果与原始证据。</p></div></div></section>
    <section id="video-links"><span class="eyebrow">04 / WATCH ELSEWHERE</span><h2>想看它实际用起来？</h2><p class="section-intro">相关视频在公域平台观看。本站目前尚未发布这款产品的自制视频，你可以先搜索其他创作者的介绍。</p><div class="video-links"><a href={`https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=${encodeURIComponent(p.name+' 测评')}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="platform-name bili">B站</span><span><strong>在 B 站搜索相关测评</strong><small>新窗口打开搜索 · 非本站自制内容</small></span><Icon name="external"/></a><a href={`https://www.xiaohongshu.com/search_result?keyword=${encodeURIComponent(p.name)}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="platform-name red">小红书</span><span><strong>在小红书看看使用分享</strong><small>新窗口打开搜索 · 部分内容需登录</small></span><Icon name="external"/></a></div></section>
    <section id="sources" class="source-section"><span class="eyebrow">05 / SOURCES & UPDATES</span><h2>信息从哪里来。</h2><a class="source-row" href={p.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>{p.brand} 官方产品页面</span><Icon name="external" size={17}/></a><p>文字按公开产品资料整理，图片来自品牌官方网站。本站未收到本页产品的付费投放或评测样机。首次整理：2026 年 9 月 18 日。</p></section>
  </div><aside class="product-aside"><span class="eyebrow">AT A GLANCE</span><h3>产品速览</h3><dl>{p.facts.map(([k,v])=><div><dt>{k}</dt><dd>{v}</dd></div>)}</dl><a href={p.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">前往品牌官网 <Icon name="external" size={17}/></a><div class="aside-tip"><strong>你更关心哪一点？</strong><p>挑选 AI 硬件时，一起考虑设备、配套软件、网络和持续使用成本。</p></div></aside></div>
  <section class="related"><div class="section-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">KEEP EXPLORING</span><h2>也许，你还会好奇。</h2></div><a class="text-link" href={withBase('/products/')}>全部硬件</a></div><div class="product-grid">{related.map(p=><ProductCard product={p}/>)}</div></section>
</div>
</Layout>
